What is the output of the following Java program featuring abstract method delegation across an inheritance hierarchy?
```java
abstract class NodeA {
    abstract int compute(int x);
}
abstract class NodeB extends NodeA {
    int multiply(int x) { return compute(x) * 2; }
}
class ConcreteNode extends NodeB {
    int compute(int x) { return x + 10; }
}
public class NodeApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        NodeB node = new ConcreteNode();
        System.out.println(node.multiply(5));
    }
}
```
